{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1231230-ivory-tower-academics","id":1231230,"title":"Ivory Tower Academics!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-29T15:32:24-07:00","id":1231230,"title":"Ivory Tower Academics!","content":"I just realized something rereading the NWO convention book...the ivory tower is comprised of academics from almost every discipline: Gender Studies to Engineering. I am personally a Classics student so this is probably the group i would have joined if mage was real...However i like many students of the humanities do not have tech skills nor much affinity if at all for the hard sciences...I can talk about elemental theory...which was debunked a long time ago, but that is because i have read aristotle from time to time....<br /> <br /> Now my question boys and girls and others of the forum! Any suggestion as to procedures for an enlightened academic without tech skills for the different spheres? Mind is one of the easiest ones so i would like to see procedures(rotes) based in the 8 other spheres <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-29T16:43:30-07:00","id":1231253,"title":"","content":"Now I actually want to see mages use Gender Studies as a focus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24271-froggo","name":"Froggo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24271_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-29T18:27:07-07:00","id":1231277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caedus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1231230-ivory-tower-academics#post1231230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just realized something rereading the NWO convention book...the ivory tower is comprised of academics from almost every discipline: Gender Studies to Engineering. I am personally a Classics student so this is probably the group i would have joined if mage was real...However i like many students of the humanities do not have tech skills nor much affinity if at all for the hard sciences...I can talk about elemental theory...which was debunked a long time ago, but that is because i have read aristotle from time to time....<br /> <br /> Now my question boys and girls and others of the forum! Any suggestion as to procedures for an enlightened academic without tech skills for the different spheres? Mind is one of the easiest ones so i would like to see procedures(rotes) based in the 8 other spheres <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You don't have to be a coder/builder to use experimental tech. I know its probably cheating though but feel you should probably have that option there. Smart drugs you use as a focus, computers built by others while you do &quot;enlightened Data analysis&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-30T01:40:50-07:00","id":1231315,"title":"","content":"There are lots of ways to incorporate psychological and sociological practices to a paradigm. While most technocrats may get training and education in basic technological practices, most NWO Agents will focus on the spheres of Mind, Entropy and the like. Not Forces, Matter or any of the &quot;solid&quot; stuff.<br /> The fiction in the Syndicate Revised book has a part where the Agent turns left on a parking lot to find a free space. He justifies this by saying that most people will turn right first and thus the right side of the parking lot will always be full first. This is the very subtle and effective magick a smart Agent of the Technocratic Union will work.<br /> <br /> Most procedures I can think of right now will probably have a Mind component. As I am short on time, I will maybe come back later to post some.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-30T05:40:08-07:00","id":1231341,"title":"","content":"You could use Classics as the basis for a management and resources focus. I mean, it used to be Classics that in a large sense defined someone as a member of the elite.<br /> <br /> Maybe you could do a Time 2 Past/Future Sight by drawing on your deep knowledge of Thucydides to predict by analogy? I mean, people do that in real-life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-30T08:11:07-07:00","id":1231357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Froggo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1231230-ivory-tower-academics?p=1231253#post1231253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I actually want to see mages use Gender Studies as a focus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apparently the members of the Gender Studies Collegia are masters schemers according to the NWO book","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8100-caedus","name":"Caedus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key